During the development of the Electorry SpA project, I focused on infrastructure, security, and deployment. 
My main contribution was configuring the Staging environment with Docker, Nginx, and PostgreSQL, ensuring the system 
was resilient with healthchecks and restart policies. I also implemented the payment gateway adapter for Mercado Pago, 
which allowed the team to continue testing despite an external provider error (DXT40). 
This experience taught me the importance of designing fault-tolerant architectures and documenting deployment decisions. 
I feel more prepared to face real-world challenges in cloud infrastructure and security.